  "prefLabel": "Env-WMC 203.02 Place of Meetings",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-06-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 203.02 Place of Meetings.\n\n(a) All regular meetings of the council shall be held in Concord.\n\n(b) Special meetings, including meetings held to inform the public or solicit public comments, shall be held in Concord or such other places as the council shall determine based on consideration of maximizing access of interested parties to the meeting.\n\nSource. #4846, eff 6-21-90, EXPIRED: 6-21-96\n\nNew. #6334, eff 9-20-96; ss by #8031, eff 1-24-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wmc200.html"
